  "solution": "**Logic: Second no. = [(First no. × Third no.) - 4]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**12 : 92 : 8 →**\n\n​⇒ [(12 × 8) - 4]\n\n​⇒ (96 - 4) = 92\n\n**16 : 92 : 6 →**\n\n​⇒ [(16 × 6) - 4]\n\n​⇒ (96 - 4) = 92\n\nChecking the given options:\n\n**(1)** 9 : 122 : 14 →\n\n​⇒ [(9 × 14) - 4]\n\n​⇒ (126 - 4) = 122\n\n**(2)** 13 : 60 : 5 →\n\n​⇒ [(13 × 5) - 5]\n\n​⇒ (65 - 5) = 60\n\n**(3) **15 : 184 : 12 →\n\n​⇒ [(15 × 12) + 4]\n\n​⇒ (180 + 4) = 184\n\n**(4)** 8 : 109 : 14 →\n\n​⇒ [(8 × 14) - 3]\n\n​⇒ (112 - 3) = 109\n\nHere, **'****9 : 122 : 14'** is similar to the given sets of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (1)\".\n\nc0:T1ee2,\n\n<",
